title: "GeoFuego Harmonization: MODIS to VIIRS-equivalent harmonized fire-hotspot calendar for Argentina, 2000 to 2025 (NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026)"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-14"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24220107"
url: "https://spaceapps.geofuego.com.ar"
