keywords: [MODIS, VIIRS, FIRMS, active fire, hotspot harmonization, fire calendar, Argentina, NASA Space Apps 2026, CONAE]
notes: "Code written with SI assistance (Claude, Anthropic); reviewed and validated by the team. Code is MIT; data products and figures are CC BY 4.0. Input data: NASA FIRMS (MODIS Collection 6/6.1 country archives, VIIRS S-NPP/NOAA-20/NOAA-21), ERA5 monthly cloud fraction and precipitation (Copernicus Climate Change Service, CDS; contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information 2026), NOAA CPC ONI, GWIS/JRC MCD64A1 country tables, IGN Argentina. Licences of all inputs are listed in README (Data sources and licences)."
